  "description": "Official .NET SDK for the Pinlyx omnichannel AI CRM platform. Strongly-typed clients for the public REST API v1 (Bearer auth): contacts, deals, tasks, finance, email inbox, Telegram + Twitter/X messaging, sequences, analytics, conversations, accounts, pipelines, AI agents, job monitor, and self-service webhooks + API keys — with scope-aware, safe-write semantics and webhook signature verification. Also HMAC-signed /public endpoints and an MCP client wrapper. Multi-targets netstandard2.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
